criteria:
Inclusion Criteria:

* Individuals must be 21-25 years of age;
* Individuals are not pregnant;
* Individuals have no history, or current diagnoses, of alcohol, drug, or psychiatric problems;
* Individuals have no medical conditions, current or chronic, contraindicating alcohol use in the study;
* Must be a regular drinker who is willing to taste a vodka-based beverage as part of the study.

Exclusion Criteria:

* Individuals who are pregnant;
* Individuals who have any medical or psychiatric problems that contraindicate the tasting of alcohol;
* Individuals taking any medication or other substance that may interact negatively with the effects of alcohol;
* Individuals who have substance abuse problems, or think they might have a substance abuse problem.
